\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Median net-load $R^2$ against averaging window, one line per consumer count, at a fixed 50\% ETL penetration. Both aggregation axes act in the same direction, and they partly substitute for one another: the spread between consumer counts narrows as the averaging window widens.}}{4}{}\protected@file@percent }
