\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Per-substation accuracy of the thermal-energy estimate against consumer count, at 25\% ETL penetration. Each box holds the 25 replicates of that cell. The median rises modestly while the spread contracts sharply, so aggregation buys reliability across substations more than accuracy at the typical one. Two substations falling below the axis are not shown.}}{6}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:energy-aggregation}{{5}{6}{}{figure.5}{}}
